      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804514266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return some shoes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40798,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804520466666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804522533332
    },
    {
      "text": "Ugh, yeah. It's VF-884-9103-B.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40798,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804527399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... Okay, I see the order for the VeloFit Pro-Lite cycling shoes, delivered on November 12th. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804529599998
    },
    {
      "text": "If you say so.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40798,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804538533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. So I can best assist you, what specifically is the issue with the shoes? Is it a technical fault or a matter of preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804539666664
    },
    {
      "text": "They gave me horrible blisters. They just don't fit right.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40798,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804548666664
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. Sometimes issues with blisters can be resolved by adjusting the cleats or trying a different insole. Did you have a chance to try any adjustments?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804552733330
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not interested in a science project. I just want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40798,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804564599996
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand completely. Let me just check the return eligibility based on the delivery date. I see it's been 21 days.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804568933329
    },
    {
      "text": "And?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40798,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804576999995
    },
    {
      "text": "And it looks like you're perfectly fine. Our policy allows for returns within 90 days, so you are well within that window. I can go ahead and approve this return for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804577699995
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. What's next?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40798,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764804589899995
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just processed the return authorization. You'll get an email shortly with a prepaid shipping label and instructions. Just box up the cycling shoes, attach the label, and you can drop them off. Once our warehouse receives the item, your full refund will be issued.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
